		{
			description: [
				"There is no single way to play. Six paths lead away from here, and each is a full adventure with its own chapters."
				""
				"&eChoosing a path reveals its chapters.&f Nothing locks you in: take one, take several, or split them between friends. A party with a Mayor, an Engineer and an Archmage is a formidable thing."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Every path has three &emilestones&f on this page. Each unlocks when you finish the linked chapter or feat - come back and claim it."
				""
				"Reach the final milestone on &aany three paths&f to become a &6Legend of Eldermoor&f."
				""
				"Your reward here is a &6choice&f: one gift for whichever calling speaks to you."
			]
